# S4 外观堆叠:条目模型属性 + 编译产物经 HTML 管线无损往返
# 模型属性逐字节往返(顺序/眼睛/混合模式)
data-vb-appearance
# 多填充:纯色层以同色双 stop 渐变承载 + background-color 底条
background-image: linear-gradient(#ff5a1f, #ff5a1f), linear-gradient(90deg, #204060 0, #90c0f0 100%)
background-color: #102030
background-blend-mode: multiply, normal
# 多效果:阴影段序 = 条目序;模糊 filter;圆角
box-shadow: 8px 12px 24px 4px #00000059, inset 0 0 10px #ffffff40
filter: blur(2px)
border-radius: 6px
# 文字外观:描边与阴影落点
-webkit-text-stroke-width: 2px
-webkit-text-stroke-color: #36f
text-shadow: 2px 2px 3px #00000080
# 描边:内侧 dashed 近似 + 外侧 outline
border-style: dashed
outline-width: 2px
outline-color: #0af
